OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry start with a mix
OL,6,Fof cloud and some spells of sunshine.
OL,7,FA few showers may develop from the
OL,8,Fmiddle of the day, especially towards
OL,9,Fthe northwest. Feeling cooler than of
OL,10,Flate, especially in the strengthening
OL,11,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOne or two showers continuing
OL,14,Fthis evening and overnight, but
OL,15,Fremaining dry for most with some clear
OL,16,Fspells. Temperatures mainly remaining
OL,17,Fin double figures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
