OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA few showers around first
OL,6,Fthing on Thursday, but these will
OL,7,Fquickly fade leaving a largely dry day
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells. Lighter winds than
OL,9,Ftoday with temperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,12,Fdry and bright on Friday and Saturday
OL,13,Fwith temperatures also increasing. A
OL,14,Frisk of some showers on Sunday but
OL,15,Fstaying dry and warm for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
